{"date":"Tuesday 24 November 2026","updated":"12:00","sub":"Tuesday 24 November 2026 · GBP/USD. Watches the London killzone so you do not have to trade it: a map at 06:40, the leg and its equilibrium at 10:00, a scorecard at noon. It never calls a trade.","feed":"<article class=\"post\"><div class=\"time\">06:40<small>Morning map</small></div><div class=\"body\"><span class=\"tag\" style=\"--k:var(--blue)\">Morning map</span><h2>The nearest real draw is the Asia low, 12 pips below.</h2><p class=\"lede\">Before London opens, this is where the resting orders are and how often price has gone to get them by noon.</p><div class=\"plan\"><header><strong>GBP/USD · 1.30449</strong><span class=\"side map\">DRAW MAP</span></header><div class=\"pools\"><div class=\"pool\"><div class=\"nm\">Asia high<small>1.30516 · 6.7p above</small></div><div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"--p:44%\"></i></div><div class=\"odds\">44%</div></div><div class=\"pool\"><div class=\"nm\">Asia low<small>1.30324 · 12.5p below</small></div><div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"--p:57%\"></i></div><div class=\"odds\">57%</div></div><div class=\"pool\"><div class=\"nm\">Last week's low<small>1.30757 · 30.8p above</small></div><div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"--p:18%\"></i></div><div class=\"odds\">18%</div></div><div class=\"pool\"><div class=\"nm\">Yesterday's low<small>1.30119 · 33.0p below</small></div><div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"--p:17%\"></i></div><div class=\"odds\">17%</div></div><div class=\"pool\"><div class=\"nm\">Yesterday's high<small>1.31457 · 100.8p above</small></div><div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"--p:4%\"></i></div><div class=\"odds\">4%</div></div></div></div><p>Nearest draw of 10+ pips: GBP/USD Asia low 1.30324, 12.5 pips below; EUR/USD Asia high 1.09205, 12.1 pips above. Calendar not pulled for this catch-up run, and the clock was checked by hand (feed UTC+11, matched to the live bars).</p><p class=\"dim\">Watching only. Handover at 10:00.</p><section class=\"stage\" aria-label=\"Session chart\"><header><div><strong id=\"cPair\"></strong><small>15m · UK time</small></div><div class=\"views\" id=\"views\"></div></header>\n<svg class=\"chart\" id=\"chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Candlestick chart of the session with the desk's levels\"></svg><div class=\"pdk\" id=\"pdk\"></div><div class=\"scap\" id=\"cap\"></div></section></div></article>\n<article class=\"post\"><div class=\"time\">10:00<small>Handover</small></div><div class=\"body\"><span class=\"tag\" style=\"--k:var(--copper)\">Killzone handover</span><h2>A 41-pip leg up. Equilibrium is 1.30501.</h2><div class=\"plan\"><header><strong>GBP/USD</strong><span class=\"side map\">HANDOVER</span></header><dl><dt>Leg</dt><dd><span class=\"px \">1.30295</span> at 07:05 → <span class=\"px \">1.30707</span> at 09:55 · 41.2 pips up</dd><dt>Equilibrium</dt><dd><span class=\"px c\">1.30501</span> · 15.5 pips below price · returns by noon on <b>52%</b> of sessions</dd></dl></div><p>Both pairs dipped a few pips under the Asia low at 07:05 (GBP/USD 1.30295, EUR/USD 1.08965), then climbed about 41 pips through the Asia high into 09:55 (GBP/USD 1.30707, EUR/USD 1.09368). Price sits about 15 pips above the killzone EQ on each (GBP/USD 1.30501, EUR/USD 1.09179); the previous week's low overhead (GBP/USD 1.30757, EUR/USD 1.09537) is still unspent. The pairs agreed, so no SMT.</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"post\"><div class=\"time\">12:00<small>Scorecard</small></div><div class=\"body\"><span class=\"tag\" style=\"--k:var(--gold)\">Scorecard</span><h2>No return to equilibrium by noon.</h2><div class=\"plan\"><header><strong>GBP/USD</strong><span class=\"side res\">SCORECARD</span></header><dl><dt>Equilibrium 1.30501</dt><dd><span class=\"r\">Not revisited</span> after 10:00</dd><dt>Asia high 1.30516</dt><dd><span class=\"g\">Reached</span> at 08:30</dd><dt>Asia low 1.30324</dt><dd><span class=\"g\">Reached</span> at 07:00</dd><dt>Last week's low 1.30757</dt><dd><span class=\"g\">Reached</span> at 11:15</dd><dt>Trades called</dt><dd>None. This desk names levels; it does not call a side.</dd></dl></div><p>The morning trended: after a shallow dip under the Asia low, both pairs ran through the Asia high and the previous week's low, and neither came back to its killzone EQ by 12:00.</p></div></article>","week":"<section class=\"week\"><h3>Meridian 2 · week of 23 Nov · equilibrium reached by noon</h3><div class=\"wk\"><div class=\"\"><small>Mon</small><b class=\"\">—</b></div><div class=\"\"><small>Tue</small><b class=\"r\">no</b></div><div class=\"\"><small>Wed</small><b class=\"\">—</b></div><div class=\"\"><small>Thu</small><b class=\"\">—</b></div><div class=\"\"><small>Fri</small><b class=\"\">—</b></div><div class=\"tot\"><small>Week</small><b class=\"\">—</b></div></div></section>","chart":{"pair":"GBP/USD","bars":[["00:00",1.30332,1.30378,1.30332,1.30363],["00:15",1.30359,1.30368,1.30324,1.30342],["00:30",1.30342,1.30383,1.30332,1.30382],["00:45",1.30378,1.30433,1.30363,1.30404],["01:00",1.30408,1.30427,1.30387,1.30395],["01:15",1.30397,1.30475,1.30393,1.30466],["01:30",1.30468,1.3049,1.30455,1.30462],["01:45",1.30463,1.30478,1.30433,1.3045],["02:00",1.30442,1.30485,1.30439,1.30471],["02:15",1.30473,1.30485,1.30443,1.30455],["02:30",1.30459,1.30459,1.30414,1.30422],["02:45",1.3042,1.30439,1.30404,1.30409],["03:00",1.30412,1.30426,1.30367,1.30397],["03:15",1.30393,1.30414,1.3037,1.30381],["03:30",1.3038,1.30426,1.30371,1.30402],["03:45",1.30407,1.3042,1.304,1.30412],["04:00",1.30408,1.30429,1.30363,1.30387],["04:15",1.3038,1.304,1.30359,1.30373],["04:30",1.30378,1.30397,1.30356,1.30376],["04:45",1.30377,1.3048,1.30344,1.30406],["05:00",1.30405,1.30439,1.3039,1.3043],["05:15",1.30421,1.30458,1.30376,1.30445],["05:30",1.30447,1.30516,1.30419,1.30453],["05:45",1.30448,1.30478,1.30402,1.30419],["06:00",1.30424,1.30433,1.30371,1.30431],["06:15",1.30426,1.30454,1.30412,1.30447],["06:30",1.30446,1.30471,1.30416,1.30449],["06:45",1.30441,1.30469,1.30351